    40	**Cutaways (~4,500):** Karis, ~2,500, on a cold night [B7-reconciled 2026-10-11: amendment 19] with the index: her want, and her refusal to theorize about the cord. Teague, ~2,000, at the upper inn: the young one asks to learn; the wrist; he cannot read the sheet and does not need to.
