   173	| 5 | No Authority | 27–33 | 35,000 | S10, S11, S12 | The archive's first days; Vastin unlearning his name; Cleon's bones; Brom offered the life; the alley and the eleventh. |
   174	| 6 | Before the Paths | 34–40 | 34,000 | S13, S14, S15, S16 | The twelfth and the warning; dividers and the light's wrong count; the leaf read once; pole two at the fire. |
   175	| 7 | The Straightedge | 41–46 | 32,000 | S17, S18 | East by the same road; two crews by contract; Force seen; the grade cracked oldest-last; Millrace and the second instrument turned inward. |
