editions/monroe-1.3/book-01-the-shattered/state/movement-006/AUTHOR-REPORT.md:208:3. **Renn II as a rebook** (coordinator note): the river held the barges, the hold lapsed on day 60, and Cael asked Renn himself at the quay. Renn made his plan public on purpose ("it won't help you"); Cael built the counter from watching it. Renn learns inside the bout (he throws the figure where the sideways boy will be).
editions/monroe-1.3/book-01-the-shattered/state/movement-006/AUTHOR-REPORT.md:210:5. **Lira's habit** is seen three times: the Brenna fourth (day 53), day 73 and day 77. It is named on day 77. **Cost**: she leaves with the bread whole and no "same time tomorrow". She makes the rule; then the room. That rule ("mine are mine") now presses directly on his *Not yet* about a fragment that is partly hers (brief: he tells her in M7).
