     6	
     7	- The night of the 270th at Lowmarch. Six at the lower inn: Cael, Lira, Brom, Karis, Seln, and Oryn, who is on her own road and takes no sixth place. Teague's five at the upper inn.
     8	- Cael: nineteen; no Path; ten fragments; **deployment since the Line twenty-nine**; Shadow twice and sealed; Anchor twice, once each way; Tide used on nobody but Oryn (twice) and himself (three times); the still place untouched; the ruling *hold* on the cord and the two edges (he has touched none of the three since the 168th).
