editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/manuscript/chapter-54.md-303-"It is alive," said Seln. He was coming back along the wall with the bow. "And it is going down, and it is hurt, and I do not know how long any of those will last. Karis. Paper. We walk."
