    83	1. **12:113** — the Compact date that the map leaves as `[a Compact date]` between "Sequence initiated" and "Unreadable." It must agree with a Kindling date that is the owner's, and it must be written without a month name in this season-blind edition; I have no source for its form. The marker is on its own line inside the set-apart sheet. Nothing nearby gives its content: the narration says only that it is "a date in the office's reckoning", that Karis copies "the office's own figures… exactly as they stood", that Seln's eyes stop at it, and that Cael "had never learned to turn [it] into days". **If the restored date has a full stop after it, or stands on the same line as "Sequence initiated", the three lines 12:111–115 want joining to suit.**
