editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/state/movement-002/plan-audit.stdout.log:8289:./editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/state/movement-002/source-tracking.stdout.log:1625:    99	"*Deep layer. Sequence initiated* — and a date." She gave the date. It was a Compact date, a registry year and a day in it, and the room did the arithmetic without being asked to, because the room had lived by the Line's count for nine months and by the Compact's for their whole lives before that, and a date was a date. Six years back. Near enough six — some months before he had begun staying out of files, which he noted, and did not follow. "*Unreadable. Not halted. Running. Correlated with classification event* —" and then the bar.
