+   old: `"Yes. I had certified that reading in every district of the Compact for forty years, and had written two sections of the protocol that governs it, and I had never once asked what the function was appended *to*." He turned his left hand over on the board, and it did not open the whole way. "I asked; and I did not ask by paper, having learned what became of my paper. I went down a stair to the house's frame shop, where an old man in an apron mends the stations' frames, and I asked him what lay under the function."`
