+   old: `"There is a thing that ought to be said, and I am the one of us who was trained to say it. In my old trade there is a grade of approach which begins exactly so. A man arrives with nothing: he has no seal, and no escort, and he limps. He has been wronged by the house that he comes from, and has left it; and he brings a gift, which is true, since only a true gift is ever opened." His hands were in his sleeves. "It is the best-made thing that the service has. I built two of them myself."`
