+   old: `"I had it from that same leaf, by inference, and from the three oldest papers in the case. I said that the reading was older than the function, and that I could not tell by how much, and that nothing in the box reached down so far. I entered it as a limit." She looked at him steadily. "I did not expect to have it confirmed by a man in an apron."`
+   new: `Karis held his eyes and said no more.`
