+19. `manuscript/chapter-12.md`
+   old: `"I cut it," said Vastin. "I shall say so before I am asked. It stood in a bound register, in a room where I had the right to read and no right to take, and I took a blade to it. I sat once upon the inquiry into an archivist who had done the same, and I found against him, and he lost his place." He did not look away from the leaf. "I was right to find so, and I should find so again, against myself. I do not offer it as a thing well done. I offer it as the only way that this line was ever going to leave that room."`
