`*Deep layer. Sequence initiated — [OWNER-SUPPLIED COMPACT DATE].*\n\n*Unreadable. Not halted. Running. Correlated with classification event —*`

The placeholder is not protected wording and cannot be ratified as final prose. No protected document is otherwise printed twice (`manuscript/chapter-11.md:105–109,239–245`; `manuscript/chapter-12.md:65,111–133`).

